cherkus> As you can see, they have very similar scores..

The advantage of the 1xx series over the 2x machines is more
expandability.  The 5k/25 maxes out at 40Mb of RAM, and two 50Mb/s
TurboChannel slots.  Can also hold two 3.5" devices inside.

The 125 can be upgraded to a 150 (R4000 at 50Mhz), has three turbo
channel slots at 100Mb/sec, and can hold more memory.  I think 480Mb
max.  Down side is that it has no room to internal disk devices.



