Hi Reece,

This problem with failing initialisation on a DEC machine using native
Ethertalk is familiar to me. You have to use the packetfilter device of
the machine:

1) Did you specify the PACKETFILTER option in the configuration file? Use
'pfstat' command to check.

2) You have to run the MAKEDEV script from the '/dev' directory to make
the packetfilter files in the '/dev/pf' directory: run 'MAKEDEV pfilt'
from the '/dev' directory.

Look at the man pages for packetfilter for more information.

