N4. How do I switch between the AUI and 10 Base-T Ethernet ports?

- Shutdown the system.
- At the ">>>" prompt, type:

	set ethernet thick
      or
      	set ethernet tenbt

- Reboot the system.
	                           [Steve Imber, stevei@anduril.fsc.qut.edu.au]

