I can't give an official answer for DEC, since I don't work for them...but I
do have some experience with the question.

Short answer: You must have OSF-BASE if you want anyone besides root to be
able to log in to an OSF/1 system at 3.0 or higher.

This one tripped me, as we bought a demo machine and didn't get the OSF-BASE
PAK with it; it took a lot of phone calls and temporary PAKs over the space
