getting one from DEC is a major pain, but at least your system will be up.

I'm a bit confused when you say that OSF-BASE came with your machine, and
then say that it costs a lot of money...

Don't forget to delete the implicit OSF-USR PAK that gets installed with the
OS, or else you will only be able to have two user logins, even if you have
an unlimited OSF-USR installed also.
