majordomo@netbsd.org with the text 'subscribe port-pmax' in the text
of the message.  This will add you to the mailing list.  You can alos
poke around the mailing list archives to get more info - send a
message to majordomo@netbsd.org with the text 'help' to figure out how
to get a hold of the archives. They're also available via anon ftp
from many NetBSD mirror sites.

