|>What are the views of the readers of this list concerning
|>the importance or unimportance of the lack of ECC or parity
|>checking memory in the new PCI Alphastations? Thank you.

The AlphaStations do have parity memory.  For the AlphaServers, which can
have more memory, and for which even the remote possibility of a memory failure
