Joseph F Castagnino (jfcal+@pitt.edu) wrote:

: Does anyone know where I could download some documentation on installing
: NFS on ULTRIX and PC Terminals.  Does anyone have any helpful tips?

NFS is native on Ultrix.  It's a mandatory layered subset.

To turn it on:

	/etc/portmap
	/etc/mountd -i
	/etc/nfsd 4

And put the exported directories into /etc/exports.
Confirm with:

	/etc/showmount -a

Barry Kort


