In article <3jidg7$fem@riscsm.scripps.edu>,
 matt@perutz.salk.edu (Matthew Bowen Harrington) writes:
>
>I want to bring a bunch of mail from VMSMail to UNIX.  I use MH on the
>UNIX side.  I've tried the script mentioned in the MH FAQ, but I
>couldn't get it to work.  Has anyone had any success converting
>VMSMail to MH or some other UNIX mail format?

I use a program called VMS2UnixMail written by Paul Puglia (who no
longer has a VMS machine, so this code is orphaned).  I can send the
VMS_SHARE file to you if you want it.  The VMS2UnixMail program creates
a <folder>.vmsmail file for each folder in the users MAIL.MAI file.  The
user then FTPs these files to the Unix side and then runs MH's inc
command against these files:

   % inc -file <folder>.vmsmail
